# Operator egress allow-list for a contained FGNW range. Applied with
#
#   ludus testing allow -f blueprints/FGNW/testing-allow.txt
#
# after EVERY `ludus testing start` -- `ludus testing stop` flushes the list and
# `testing start` rebuilds the router chain from the range config alone.
# See campaign/docs/isolate-testing.md.
#
# One IP or domain per line, starting at column 1. Lines that do not begin with
# an IP or domain (comments, blank lines) are ignored. Copy this file to
# testing-allow.txt (gitignored: it names YOUR collectors) and edit the entries.

# A collector outside the range that the VMs report to (Velociraptor frontend,
# SIEM forwarder, ...). Replace the RFC 5737 placeholder with your server's IP.
203.0.113.10

# Nexus -- only needed when a campaign or role step that pulls from it runs
# while testing is on. deploy.yml's Phase 2 already allow-lists it; a range
# contained by hand does not have it until this file is applied.
192.0.2.2
